#: ../../index.rst:3
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "Kom godt i gang"

#: ../../index.rst:6
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduktion"

#: ../../index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Welcome to the CentreStack Quick Start Guide. This guide describes on a "
"high level how you can use CentreStack to provide a managed file sync and"
" share solution for your internal employees and customers."
msgstr "Velkommen til CentreStack Quick Start Guide. Denne guide beskriver på et overordnet niveau, hvordan du kan bruge CentreStack til at tilbyde en administreret filsynkronisering og delingsløsning for dine interne medarbejdere og kunder."

#: ../../index.rst:13
msgid ""
"The goal is to provide your customers and internal employees an easy-to-"
"use and secure-under-control way to access file servers from remote "
"locations and mobile devices."
msgstr "Målet er at give dine kunder og interne medarbejdere en nem og sikker-under-kontrol måde at få adgang til filservere fra fjerne steder og mobile enheder."

#: ../../index.rst:19
msgid "Three Deployment Modes"
msgstr "Tre udrulningsmetoder"

#: ../../index.rst:21
msgid ""
"To get started, the first question is where and how to deploy "
"CentreStack. Does CentreStack need to be next to the file server, in a "
"data center or just use the Cloud version from CentreStack itself?"
msgstr "For at komme i gang er det første spørgsmål, hvor og hvordan CentreStack skal implementeres. Skal CentreStack være ved siden af filserveren, i et datacenter eller bare bruge Cloud-versionen fra CentreStack selv?"

#: ../../index.rst:25
msgid "There are three basic ways to deploy the CentreStack solution:"
msgstr "Der er tre grundlæggende måder at implementere CentreStack-løsningen på:"

#: ../../index.rst:27 ../../index.rst:32
msgid "On-Premise Self-Hosted"
msgstr "On-Premise Self-Hosted"

#: ../../index.rst:28 ../../index.rst:51
msgid "Data-Center MSP-Hosted"
msgstr "Data-Center MSP-Hosted"

#: ../../index.rst:29 ../../index.rst:66
msgid "Cloud SaaS-Hosted"
msgstr "Cloud SaaS-hostet"

#: ../../index.rst:34
msgid ""
"For the on-premise self-hosted Centrestack, the CentreStack server is "
"directly installed in the company network. On one-hand, it is facing the "
"Internet with port 443 (HTTPS) like any web server does; and on the "
"other-hand, it is connecting to company internal network and IT "
"infrastructures such as File Servers and Active Directory. CentreStack "
"server normally sits in the DMZ or behind a firewall to be protected "
"against un-authorized outside access."
msgstr "For den lokale selvhostede CentreStack er CentreStack-serveren direkte installeret i virksomhedens netværk. På den ene side er den vendt mod internettet med port 443 (HTTPS) ligesom enhver webserver gør; og på den anden side er den forbundet til virksomhedens interne netværk og IT-infrastrukturer såsom filservere og Active Directory. CentreStack-serveren sidder normalt i DMZ eller bag en firewall for at være beskyttet mod uautoriseret adgang udefra."

#: ../../index.rst:40
msgid ""
"The business objective is giving mobile and remote access to file servers"
" without the need of a VPN. It is more productive than traditional VPN  "
"by greatly reducing the number of VPN support tickets for internal "
"enterprise IT department or for the managed service provider."
msgstr "Forretningsmålet er at give mobil og fjernadgang til filservere uden behov for en VPN. Det er mere produktivt end traditionel VPN ved at reducere antallet af VPN-supportbilletter for den interne IT-afdeling i virksomheden eller for udbyderen af administrerede tjenester."

#: ../../index.rst:47
msgid "For this deployment mode, check :doc:`on_premise`"
msgstr "For denne udrulningsmetode, tjek :doc:`on_premise`"

#: ../../index.rst:53
msgid ""
"If you are a managed service provider that manages hundreds or thousands "
"of end points across multiple clients, it is a good option that you setup"
" your CentreStack server in a data center."
msgstr "Hvis du er en administreret tjenesteudbyder, der administrerer hundreder eller tusinder af endepunkter på tværs af flere klienter, er det en god mulighed, at du opsætter din CentreStack-server i et datacenter."

#: ../../index.rst:56
msgid ""
"There are a couple advantages of setting the CentreStack server up in a "
"data center."
msgstr "Der er et par fordele ved at opsætte CentreStack-serveren i et datacenter."

#: ../../index.rst:58
msgid ""
"The data center is closer to the Internet backbone than a business office"
" is, thus it has faster Internet speed."
msgstr "Datacentret er tættere på internettets rygrad end et forretningskontor, og derfor har det hurtigere internethastighed."

#: ../../index.rst:59
msgid ""
"Setting it up in a central location and in a multi-tenant fashion, it is "
"easier to manage as compared to a one-centrestack-instance-per-client "
"setup."
msgstr "Ved at opsætte det på et centralt sted og på en multi-tenant måde, er det lettere at administrere sammenlignet med en opsætning med én CentreStack-instans per klient."

#: ../../index.rst:63
msgid "For this deployment mode, check :doc:`data_center`"
msgstr "For denne udrulningsmetode, tjek :doc:`data_center`"

#: ../../index.rst:68
msgid ""
"Similar to Data-Center MSP-Hosted, CentreStack has a Cloud version that "
"is readily hosted."
msgstr "Ligesom Data-Center MSP-Hosted har CentreStack en Cloud-version, der allerede er hosted."

#: ../../index.rst:70
msgid ""
"This works well for managed service providers who have smaller clients "
"here and there. Because of the smaller number of total clients, the Data-"
"Center MSP-Hosted overhead is relatively high. MSPs can use the Cloud "
"version since it is readily deployed and ready to use."
msgstr "Dette fungerer godt for administrerede tjenesteudbydere, der har mindre klienter hist og her. På grund af det mindre antal samlede klienter er overhead for Data-Center MSP-Hosted forholdsvis højt. MSP'er kan bruge Cloud-versionen, da den er hurtigt udrullet og klar til brug."

#: ../../index.rst:76
msgid "For this deployment mode, check :doc:`cloud_host`"
msgstr "For denne udrulningsmetode, tjek :doc:`cloud_host`"

#: ../../index.rst:80
msgid "What's Next"
msgstr "Hvad er det næste"

#: ../../index.rst:82
msgid ""
"You will need a CentreStack partner account to start with, regardless of "
"which deployment mode(s) you will use. Step #1 will always be going to "
"the centrestack.com and to register. When you are on the CentreStack web "
"site, you can follow any \"Try CentreStack Free\" link to start."
msgstr "Du skal bruge en CentreStack partnerkonto for at komme i gang, uanset hvilken udrulningsmetode(r) du vil bruge. Trin #1 vil altid være at gå til centrestack.com og registrere dig. Når du er på CentreStacks hjemmeside, kan du følge et hvilket som helst \"Prøv CentreStack gratis\" link for at starte."

#: ../../index.rst:88
msgid ""
"Once you are done registering, you will be in the partner portal where "
"you can download the software, setup hosted trial and etc."
msgstr "Når du er færdig med at registrere dig, vil du være i partnerportalen, hvor du kan downloade softwaren, opsætte hosted prøveversion og lignende."

#: ../../index.rst:94
msgid "This quick start guide is written against CentreStack version |release|"
msgstr "Denne hurtigstartguide er skrevet til CentreStack version |release|"

